# Default / core dependency pins for the scraping pipeline.
#
# Source of truth for *installable* packaging is Scraping_project/pyproject.toml
# ([project] dependencies + optional-dependencies ml/ocr/dev).
# This file feeds the historical requirements.txt lock for Docker/CI that still
# use `pip install -r requirements.txt`. Prefer:
#   pip install -e ".[dev]"
# for local work after #143.
